摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"AI 足迹 — 跨平台智能收藏管理工具。AI自动分类整理、共享协作、Agent API接入。支持PC/手机H5/浏览器扩展。","id":"gh:1282724982","install_available":false,"language":"Python","name":"url-manager","slug":"Piccolo123/url-manager","topics":["agent-skills","ai-agent","bookmark-manager","chinese","claude-skill","collection-manager","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","hermes","shared-collections"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"AI 足迹 — 跨平台智能收藏管理工具。AI自动分类整理、共享协作、Agent API接入。支持PC/手机H5/浏览器扩展。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# URL Manager — Agent-first URL collection & knowledge management"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Deliver results as beautiful cards, not raw link dumps.** An agentskills.io-compatible skill that "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"lets AI agents save, organize, search, and share web resources on behalf of human users. Agents auto"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"-register on first use — zero manual setup."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> 📖 **Agent instructions** → SKILL.md\n>\n> 🇨🇳 **中文版** → SKILL.zh-CN.md"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What This Tool Gives Humans"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The content human users want to save is everywhere — a YouTube workout video, an Amazon gear link, a"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" Substack training plan — scattered across platforms with no connection. **URL Manager fixes this.**"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" Paste any link from any platform. AI auto-identifies the content and suggests a category — confirm "},{"id":"p6s4","text":"and it's a footprint. All saves flow into one platform-agnostic library, organized and always findab"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"le. Then share in one click."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Works across Hermes, Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, and any agentskills.io-compatible agent."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## DeepSeek Harness (dsh)"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness natively supports both skill files and MCP servers — URL Manager plugs in either wa"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"epSeek Harness natively supports both skill files and MCP servers — URL Manager plugs in either way."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Option A — Skill (recommended, zero extra deps)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Clone into any skill discovery root, or add this repo's root as a custom skill dir:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Restart the session — `url-manager` appears in `<available_skills>`, and the model loads it on deman"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"d via the `skill` tool."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Option B — MCP server (full 21-tool API surface)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Add to your profile's `cordis.patch.yml` (e.g. `~/.dsh/profiles/headless/cordis.patch.yml` or the `w"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"rofile's `cordis.patch.yml` (e.g. `~/.dsh/profiles/headless/cordis.patch.yml` or the `web` profile):"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"All 21 tools appear as `mcp__url_manager__*` (add_footprint, search_footprints, list_categories, age"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"nt_magic_link, …). The model auto-registers on first use — no API key needed."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## How Agents Use It"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- **Agent-first auto-registration** — zero human setup\n- **Save anything** — web links (URL auto-fet"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ched) or plain-text notes\n- **Full-text search** — across titles, descriptions, and AI summaries\n- *"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"*Categories, tags, category sets** — hierarchical organization\n- **Shared categories** — team collab"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"oration with cocreate (co-editing) and subscribe (read-only) modes\n- **Batch operations** — reorgani"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"ze up to 50 items at once\n- **Magic link delivery** — send organized collections as a polished card "},{"id":"p23s6","text":"interface\n- **Cross-platform** — Hermes, Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, OpenClaw"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Privacy"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"This skill connects to a hosted backend at **ai.ocean94.com**. On first use, the agent auto-creates "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"an account. All collected URLs and data are stored on this backend."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- Users can delete their data at any time via the web interface\n- Collected data is accessible only "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"to the account owner\n- Terms of Service · Privacy Policy"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"MIT — see LICENSE."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
